Package: com.ac3xx.lyricalizer
Name: Lyricalizer LRCLIB
Version: 1.4.2-lrclib3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Lyricalizer for iOS 6 with LRCLIB, direct live MusicLyricsView updates, multiple lyric-source fallbacks, bundled TLS 1.2 and CA roots. No TLSFix required.
Maintainer: RaulKong89 community port
Author: ac3xx (original Lyricalizer), LRCLIB community backend
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 5.0), mobilesubstrate
Homepage: https://github.com/ac3xx/Lyricalizer
